# round 8 (w19): FBA readout at width 12, two blocks. Graph regularization OFF: its config pins nine graphs to heads 0 to 8 of the SECOND block, so a one-block cell never applies it and a two-block cell with four heads indexes head 4 and dies (job 2261).
